{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.7876263, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.787629+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "### Summary of Key Findings"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.792038, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.792040+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**1. Zero threat footprint.** SILEGNA's name, MMSI, and callsign return zero results across all search engines. No incident reports, no dark web mentions, no news articles \u2014 the vessel doesn't exist outside AIS aggregators."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.7965095, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.796512+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**2. Operator has no public profile.** No management chain, no commercial registration, no owner identification available. Private individual operating under Estonian recreational registry (no IMO)."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.8018913, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.801894+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**3. Vessel-type risk is the lowest tier.** Pleasure craft are below the threshold of meaningful cyber threat. No cargo, no ransom potential, no espionage value, no corporate intelligence, no crew."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.8062842, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.806287+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**4. Geopolitical context is LOW concern.** The only realistic threat affecting SILEGNA is regional GPS/GNSS jamming in the Gulf of Finland from Russian EW activity \u2014 and that affects *all* vessels in the area, not this one in particular."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.8107457, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.810748+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**5. AIS exploitation is theoretically possible but pointless.** Passive VHF interception with an RTL-SDR is trivially easy in Tallinn harbor, but yields no attacker benefit. AIS message injection (spoofing) requires VHF proximity and specialized equipment with zero payoff."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.8151584, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.815161+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**6. No M-SOC integration warranted.** No network traffic, no log sources, no detection rules to write. This vessel's security posture depends entirely on physical security at the marina, not cyber monitoring."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.8190017, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.819004+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "**7. Overall risk tier: VERY LOW.** Close investigation. The most impactful recommendation is standard marina theft prevention and basic cyber hygiene for the owner's personal electronics."}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460276.822907, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:04:36.822909+00:00", "phase": 4, "line": "| Scenario | Likelihood | Impact |"}
